<p>I kind of like the idea of future selves manifesting to try and influence their collective &quot;iteration zero&quot; to realize them. However, I was more intruigued by the concept that these future selves are essentially trying to murder each other and realize themselves- think of it like the sand tiger sharks. SCP-2455 is the pregnant mother with hundreds and hundreds of eggs and fetuses, the future selves being her young that are eating each other so that only one survives.</p>
